  "details": "I've had \"random\" crashes since I started playing, sometimes I can play for up to 30 minutes but most of the time I'll end up crashing after sometimes not even a few minutes.\nI couldn't figure out what was happening or why it happened, I tried verifying files and reinstalling.\nIt happens often when I change worlds, but if I relaunch after a crash I can load into the world I just tried entering, then it just crashes somewhere else sooner or later.\n\nThe only message I get is \"Please send the crash dump to a developer\", so I have been trying to find a mail/place to seek help or send my logs. I have it all saved externally, I believe.",
